  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186124474,
      "id": "149fa184-850f-52d8-a309-4b79a371a74d",
      "title": "Identifying the Intervals on Which a Function is Invertible Given a Description"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "e803f937-5f17-5709-933a-2a499cafc217",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Given that $f(x)=|x-3|+6,$ on which of the following intervals is $f(x)$ invertible?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x\\in (-\\infty,2]$\n- **II.** $x\\in (2,\\infty)$\n- **III.** $x\\in (3,5]$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The graph of the function $f(x)=|x-3|+6$ can be obtained in the following way:\n\n- Take the curve $y=|x|.$\n\n- Translate it by $3$ units to the right,  to get $y=|x-3|.$\n\n- Finally, translate $y=|x-3|$ by $6$ units up to get $f(x)=|x-3|+6.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186124474/plots/e95ab24091b380e5660d2a866d64d0292edbdc9f93c796ee35a8c4de5f9979c4-0.png)\n\nA function is invertible on a particular interval if and only if it's a one-to-one function on that interval. To determine the intervals on which the function is invertible, we use the horizontal line test. \n\n- The function $f(x)$ is invertible on each of the intervals $x\\in (-\\infty,2]$ and $x\\in (3,5].$ On these intervals, a horizontal line will intersect the curve at most once, no matter where we draw the line.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186124474/plots/e95ab24091b380e5660d2a866d64d0292edbdc9f93c796ee35a8c4de5f9979c4-1.png)\n\n  \n\n- The function $f(x)$ is not invertible on the interval $x\\in (2,\\infty).$ On this interval, some horizontal lines will intersect the curve more than once.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186124474/plots/e95ab24091b380e5660d2a866d64d0292edbdc9f93c796ee35a8c4de5f9979c4-2.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "0263bc40-6399-51dd-9d11-bdf1444746b8",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "cab346ab-459a-5a77-bd95-eefd4ccc25b7",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "c5612ce8-549b-50fa-9234-02e69252a57e",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "c5612ce8-549b-50fa-9234-02e69252a57e"
          ]
        },
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "8b2efbf5-9640-501b-9913-54bc78138ff9",
          ":answer-field/key": "II",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
