  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186124474,
      "id": "149fa184-850f-52d8-a309-4b79a371a74d",
      "title": "Identifying the Intervals on Which a Function is Invertible Given a Description"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "9f4d8fa1-95d3-5720-be07-1f1958303b0a",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Given that $f(x)=|x-4|-6,$ on which of the following intervals is $f(x)$ invertible?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x\\in (-\\infty,4]$\n\n- **II.** $x\\in (4,\\infty)$\n\n- **III.** $x\\in (-\\infty,5]$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The graph of the function $f(x)=|x-4|-6$ can be obtained in the following way:\n\n1\\. Take the curve $y=|x|.$\n\n2\\. Translate it by $4$ units to the right,  to get $y=|x-4|.$\n\n3\\. Finally, translate $y=|x-4|$ by $6$ units down to get $f(x)=|x-4|-6.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186124474/plots/d71828074bb350842b8189308374719e1ceef379d2699f8cf65b756b627b5989-0.png)\n\nA function is invertible on a particular interval if and only if it's a one-to-one function on that interval. To determine the intervals on which the function is invertible, we use the horizontal line test. \n\n- The function $f(x)$ is invertible on each of the intervals $x\\in (-\\infty,4]$ and $x\\in (4,\\infty).$ On these intervals, a horizontal line will intersect the curve at most once, no matter where we draw the line.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186124474/plots/d71828074bb350842b8189308374719e1ceef379d2699f8cf65b756b627b5989-1.png)\n\n  \n\n- The function $f(x)$ is not invertible on the interval $x\\in (-\\infty,5].$ On this interval, some horizontal lines will intersect the curve more than once.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186124474/plots/d71828074bb350842b8189308374719e1ceef379d2699f8cf65b756b627b5989-2.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I  and II only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "0eb90967-f322-5130-93db-945f15b39ca9",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
